cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PowerLift Tracker: a powerlifting training tracker built on Google Sheets"
abstract: >-
  Google Sheets template to plan and track powerlifting training over a
  10-week block: e1RM estimated from the RPE chart, planned loads rounded to
  2.5 kg, reference MAXs updated every week from the actual performance,
  fatigue index and bodyweight handling for weighted pull-ups and dips, with
  user guides in English and French.
authors:
  - given-names: Romain
    family-names: Ben
version: 1.0.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BnRomain/PowerLiftingTracker"
url: "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1cMEQfgsgYV3C5RC8sq0Xvccz4UgO5aT8dhn19qVybdU/edit?usp=sharing"
keywords:
